title: "ZIF Biocomposite Explorer"
abstract: "Interactive Flask application for exploring ZIF biocomposite datasets across ternary composition, concentration, phase assignment, crystallinity, encapsulation efficiency, ATR-IR and XRD spectra, and model-derived prediction overlays."
